// An empty directory at the plate temp name is not the plate file.
// The write removes that directory only when it is empty.
// A directory that still holds a name stays, and the write does not enter it.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE tmpdir ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law    ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG tmpdir law

IMPULSE tmpdir 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "tmpdir" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
